<section id="women-safety" style="padding:2.5rem 0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 20%,rgba(244,63,94,.14),transparent 60%),radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 90%,rgba(168,85,247,.12),transparent 50%),rgba(2,6,23,.6);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(244,63,94,.2)"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><div class="section-tag" style="color:#fb7185;border-color:#fb718555;background:#fb718511">SheGuard - Women Safety</div><h2>Futuristic Female Safety <span style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fb7185,#f472b6,#a78bfa);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent">AI Command Center</span></h2><p>Next-generation protection for every woman: AI predictive guardian, one-tap SOS, blockchain evidence vault, danger-zone map and instant helplines</p></div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:1.2rem;align-items:stretch"><div class="pcard reveal rd0" style="padding:1.4rem;border-left:4px solid #f43f5e"><h4 style="margin:0 0 .6rem;font-size:1.05rem;color:#fff"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt" style="color:#fb7185;margin-right:.4rem"></i>One-Tap SOS Shield</h4><p style="font-size:.85rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);margin:0">Instant panic alert with live GPS to police 999, women helpline 109 and your trusted circle. Voice-activated in Bengali and English.</p></div><div class="pcard reveal rd1" style="padding:1.4rem;border-left:4px solid #a855f7"><h4 style="margin:0 0 .6rem;font-size:1.05rem;color:#fff"><i class="fas fa-brain" style="color:#c084fc;margin-right:.4rem"></i>AI Predictive Guardian</h4><p style="font-size:.85rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);margin:0">Deep-learning risk prediction, safe-route navigation and 64-zone live danger map across all districts of Bangladesh.</p></div><div class="pcard reveal rd2" style="padding:1.4rem;border-left:4px solid #f59e0b"><h4 style="margin:0 0 .6rem;font-size:1.05rem;color:#fff"><i class="fas fa-gavel" style="color:#fbbf24;margin-right:.4rem"></i>Rights + Blockchain Evidence</h4><p style="font-size:.85rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);margin:0">Know every women-protection law with one-tap helplines, plus tamper-proof court-admissible evidence vault.</p></div></div><div style="text-align:center;margin-top:1.8rem"><a href="female-safety.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;padding:.85rem 2.4rem;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#e11d48,#f43f5e);border-radius:2.4rem;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(244,63,94,.4);transition:all .2s">&#128737;&#65039; Enter SheGuard Command Center</a></div></div></section>

id="contact" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(14,165,233,.1),rgba(99,102,241,.1));border-top:1px solid var(--gb);border-bottom:1px solid var(--gb)"><div class="container" style="text-align:center">
<h2 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-bottom:1rem">Join the Justice Revolution</h2>
<p style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:1.1rem;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 2rem;line-height:1.7">Whether developer, lawyer, policymaker, or donor across any of the 64 districts - there is a role for you.</p>
<div style="display:flex;gap:1rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap"><a href="mailto:jin.choi@undp.org" class="btn-p"><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> Contact Project Lead</a><a href="#" class="btn-s"><i class="fas fa-download"></i> Download PRD</a></div>
</div></section>
<button class="back-to-top" id="backToTop" aria-label="Back to top"><i class="fas fa-arrow-up"></i></button>
<footer><div class="fgrid">
<div><a href="#" class="nav-logo" style="margin-bottom:1rem;display:inline-flex"><span>A ai</span></a><p>Next-Gen Digital Legal Aid - Access to justice for 682,500+ citizens across all 64 districts.</p></div>
<div class="fcol"><h4>Platform</h4><a href="#features">Features</a><a href="#solution">Architecture</a><a href="#personas">Personas</a><a href="#impact">Impact</a></div>
<div class="fcol"><h4>Project</h4><a href="#roadmap">Roadmap</a><a href="#partners">Partners</a><a href="#flow">User Flows</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></div>
